{
  "provenance": "A real Anycubic Kobra X on the community Kobrian image (Debian 13, vanilla Klipper 6af413d-dirty) as its owner's machine reports itself (debug bundle JYTPVPP9)",
  "notes": [
    "hostname is the Kobrian image's own pattern, kobrian-kx-<suffix>. It never contains 'kobra', so the Anycubic Kobra entry's 'kobra' hostname heuristic does not fire.",
    "The KX multi-material head registers kx_toolchanger, kx_selector and kx_filament, and the ACEPRO driver registers ace / ace_state / ace_instance_0. GoKlipper's filament_hub, which every Kobra 3 and S1 entry keys on, is absent.",
    "steppers is ['stepper_enable']: discovery buckets any object with the 'stepper_' prefix, and the object list carries no bare stepper_x/y/z, only their tmc2209 sections.",
    "build_volume is the stepper travel discovery logged: X[-18,280] Y[-6,272] Z[0,262] (printer.cfg position_min -18.5/-6.5, position_max 280/272.5).",
    "The mainboard and nozzle MCUs report stm32f103xe."
  ],
